# Flutter Analyze

Do **not** use the `user-dart` MCP `analyze_files` tool. It hangs with no output when called with `roots` / `paths` and blocks the session.

Use the Shell tool instead:

```bash
# Full project
flutter analyze

# Specific files or directories
flutter analyze lib/features/anime/widgets/anime_details_streams.dart
flutter analyze lib/features/anime/
```

`dart analyze` with the same paths is also fine when you only need static analysis.

## Wrong (do not use)

```
CallMcpTool → user-dart → analyze_files
{
  "roots": [{ "root": "file:///.../apps/mobile", "paths": ["lib/..."] }]
}
```

## Right

```bash
cd apps/mobile && flutter analyze lib/features/anime/
```
